OL,3,GNEWSATurning the tides: Could hidden
OL,4,Asea power energise our coastal towns?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As an engineer we do the maths and
OL,7,Fstuff," he says, "but sometimes you can
OL,8,Fget a lot more from actually touching
OL,9,Fthe water and feeling it".
